{"path":"\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/' data-target='root' data-title=''>&#8962; <\/a>\r\n\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer' data-target='computer' data-title='Computer'>\r\n\t\t\tComputer\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer\/os' data-target='computer\/os' data-title='OS'>\r\n\t\t\tOS\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer\/os\/windows' data-target='computer\/os\/windows' data-title='Windows'>\r\n\t\t\tWindows\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n","async":"0","desc":"Enable AHCI on Windows 10 with bcdedit safe mode, and the Windows XP iaStorV and storahci registry values (untested).","label":"AHCI","prevArticle":{"id":"computer\/os\/windows\/efs","label":"EFS","url":"\/computer\/os\/windows\/efs"},"nextArticle":{"id":"computer\/os\/windows\/environment_variable","label":"Environment variable","url":"\/computer\/os\/windows\/environment_variable"},"languageSwitcher":"<div id='language-switcher'>\n<\/div>\n","content":"<div id='message'>\n\t<h2>Windows 10<\/h2>\n\t<p>\n\t\tEnable safe mode:\n\t<\/p>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>bcdedit \/set {current} safeboot minimal<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<p>\n\t\tor:\n\t<\/p>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>bcdedit \/set safeboot minimal<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<p>\n\t\tEnable AHCI in the BIOS. Boot into safe mode. Clear the safemode boot:\n\t<\/p>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>bcdedit \/deletevalue {current} safeboot<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<p>\n\t\tor:\n\t<\/p>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>bcdedit \/deletevalue safeboot<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<p>\n\t\tReboot normally.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tCaution: <code class='inline'>bcdedit<\/code> changes the boot configuration.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h2>Windows XP<\/h2>\n\t<p>\n\t\tTo test. See [how to enable AHCI mode for SATA in the BIOS without reinstalling Windows](https:\/\/hetmanrecovery.com\/recovery_news\/how-to-enable-ahci-mode-for-sata-in-the-bios-without-reinstalling-windows.htm).\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tUnder <code class='inline'>HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\\SYSTEM\\CurrentControlSet\\Services\\<\/code>:\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h4>iaStorV<\/h4>\n\t<p>\n\t\t<code class='inline'>start<\/code> <code class='inline'>0<\/code>. Under <code class='inline'>StartOverride<\/code>, value <code class='inline'>0<\/code> is <code class='inline'>0<\/code>.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h4>storahci<\/h4>\n\t<p>\n\t\t<code class='inline'>start<\/code> <code class='inline'>0<\/code>. Under <code class='inline'>StartOverride<\/code>, value <code class='inline'>0<\/code> is <code class='inline'>0<\/code>.\n\t<\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n<div id='updated-container'>\r\n\t<div id='updated'>\r\n\t\tUpdated:\r\n\t\t<span id='date'>\r\n\t\t\t2026 Aug 19\t\t<\/span>\r\n\t<\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<div class='center' id='content-body-separator'><\/div>\r\n<div id='sub-list' class='center page-list'>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<div id='fb_components'>\r\n\t<div class=\"fb-comments\"\n  data-href=\"https:\/\/ujnotes.com\/computer\/os\/windows\/enable_ahci\"\n  data-numposts=\"50\">\n<\/div>\n\t<div class=\"fb-like\"\n  data-href=\"https:\/\/ujnotes.com\/computer\/os\/windows\/enable_ahci\"\n  data-layout=\"button\"\n  data-action=\"like\"\n  data-size=\"small\"\n  data-show-faces=\"false\"\n  data-share=\"true\">\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\r\n<div id='nav-list' class='center page-list'>\r\n\t<a id='nav-menu-prev'\r\n\t\t\tclass='XURL item_block_container' href='\/computer\/os\/windows\/efs' data-target='computer\/os\/windows\/efs' data-title='EFS' >\r\n\t\t<img class='item_block_image item_block_image_visible' src='\/resource\/placeholder.svg' loading='lazy' alt='Navigation - previous page tile'><div class='item_block_text'><div class='arrow'>&#x25C4;<\/div><div>EFS<\/div><\/div>\r\n\t\t<\/a><a id='nav-menu-next'\r\n\t\t\tclass='XURL item_block_container' href='\/computer\/os\/windows\